        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/mass-effect-shepard-sad.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>EA <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/bioware-closing-down-mass-effect-5-cancelled\">has closed its longtime studio partner BioWare</a>, the iconic development house behind <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/mass-effect\">Mass Effect</a> and Dragon Age, impacting around 50 staff who were in pre-production on the next Mass Effect game. In the aftermath of EA's decision, one of those affected has shared a little about the project, claiming it would have featured unprecedented levels of player freedom and choice reactivity.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/cancelled-mass-effect-bioware-unprecedented-levels-of-autonomy\">Read more</a></p>",
